 note that $\\sqrt{16-2t}+1>1$ for all $t<8.$ Consequently, the range of $y$ is\n\n$$\ny>1.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14055537/state.json" "file_sha256" "4327eb4496c527ad13ff882fcb6a6f1dbd6cf80f251bbf1c60d11ab4257da82a"} {"question" "q-327852" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14055537/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "9f497ca129fe4bf8685b22d6f9988e14863b69109af99567731e9124323fc418"} {"question" "q-327852" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14055537/state.json" "file_sha256" "4327eb4496c527ad13ff882fcb6a6f1dbd6cf80f251bbf1c60d11ab4257da82a"} {"question" "q-327852" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math ">"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14055537/state.json" "file_sha256" "4327eb4496c527ad13ff882fcb6a6f1dbd6cf80f251bbf1c60d11ab4257da82a"} {"question" "q-327852" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14055537/state.json" "file_sha256" "4327eb4496c527ad13ff882fcb6a6f1dbd6cf80f251bbf1c60d11ab4257da82a"} {"question" "q-327852" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "0"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14055537/state.json" "file_sha256" "4327eb4496c527ad13ff882fcb6a6f1dbd6cf80f251bbf1c60d11ab4257da82a"} {"question" "q-327852" "field" "field-3" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value"